## Login Checklist — OpenCart Demo

### Preconditions
- [ ] User has a registered account
- [ ] User is logged out
- [ ] Application is accessible
- [ ] User is on the Login page

---

### Login Page UI
- [ ] Login page opens successfully
- [ ] Page title is displayed correctly
- [ ] Email field is displayed
- [ ] Password field is displayed
- [ ] Login button is displayed
- [ ] Forgotten Password link is displayed

---

### Valid Login
- [ ] Login with valid email and password
- [ ] User is logged in successfully
- [ ] User is redirected after login

---

### Invalid Login
- [ ] Login with invalid email
- [ ] Login with invalid password
- [ ] Login with empty fields
- [ ] Error message is displayed for invalid credentials

---

### Field Validation
- [ ] Password field masks input
- [ ] Email field accepts valid format
- [ ] Invalid email format is rejected

---

### Negative Scenarios (basic)
- [ ] Submit form with empty fields
- [ ] Proper error message is displayed

---

### Forgotten Password
- [ ] Forgotten Password page opens
